      "hint_met": "Mission Elapsed Time: the clock since launch. Pause it from the header.",
      "hint_morale": "Rises or falls with how you handle mission events.",
      "hint_quiz": "Space knowledge check: five questions after TLI, five after TEI.",
      "hint_samples": "Rocks bagged during the moonwalk. Four earns the geology badge.",
      "hint_xp": "Points from good decisions, rock samples and quiz answers.",
      "how_decide": "Decide",
      "how_decide_desc": "Three timing calls are graded: the TLI burn window, the mid-course correction, and the entry angle.",
      "how_fly": "Fly",
