      "how_it_works": "🧭 HOW THIS MISSION WORKS",
      "how_walk": "Walk",
      "how_walk_desc": "On the surface you collect rocks and deploy an instrument. Quizzes come after TLI and TEI, and the debrief grades it all.",
      "how_watch": "Watch",
      "how_watch_desc": "Launch, lunar orbit, ascent and re-entry play out on their own. The banner under each one turns green when its milestone lands.",
