      "pathto_desc": "Pick a destination career. See the typical credentials, paid stepping-stone jobs, and adjacent entry points that lead there.",
      "pedagogical_goal": "Pedagogical goal: ",
      "personal_brand_desc": "5 sections: why it matters in 2026, foundation work (audit, LinkedIn, domain, photo), creating content (the engine), platform strategy, mistakes to avoid. Strong personal brand multiplies network + opportunity + career insurance.",
      "personal_finance_desc": "6 sections: foundation (order of operations), debt strategy, retirement accounts, taxes, insurance, investing basics. Career decisions + financial decisions interact. Not financial advice but enough to know what questions to ask.",
