      "skymap_focus_track_active": "Focus mode: unrelated marks are dimmed; the gold ring marks the target and the solid gold arc traces its next 12 hours above the horizon.",
      "solar_safety_equipment": "Use certified solar viewing equipment or safe projection only. Never look directly at the Sun.",
      "star_equipment": "A naked-eye target when it is above the horizon after dark under reasonably clear skies.",
      "targets_above_horizon": "targets are above your horizon.",
