      "5_10_minutes_maximum_per_encounter_eve": "5-10 minutes maximum per encounter. Even non-touching observation has stress cost. Leave + return if you want more time, ideally from a different angle.",
      "5_10_years": "5-10 years",
      "5_15_second_clips_show_behavior_motion": "5-15 second clips show behavior + motion. Most identification + behavioral analysis is impossible from a single still.",
