      "ultrasonic_canes_and_wearable_devices_": "Ultrasonic canes and wearable devices help blind individuals navigate by converting sonar echoes into vibrations or audio tones — giving humans a form of echolocation.",
      "ultrasound_imaging_sends_1_20_mhz_puls": "Ultrasound imaging sends 1-20 MHz pulses into the body and builds images from echoes. The same physics as echolocation, just at higher frequencies and through tissue instead of air.",
