      "yes_but_only_after_many_generations_of": "Yes — but only after many generations of weightlifting",
      "yes_but_only_if_many_giraffes_need_it_": "Yes — but only if many giraffes need it at once",
      "yes_every_aspect_of_evolution_is_purel": "Yes — every aspect of evolution is purely random",
