      "on_the_helpline": "On the helpline: ",
      "on_tiktok_long_press_a_video_not_inter": "On TikTok, long-press a video → \"Not interested.\" On Instagram, three-dot menu → \"Not interested.\" On YouTube, three-dot menu → \"Don't recommend channel.\" Each tap retrains the algorithm. After a few days the feed shifts.",
