      "note_on_the_silhouettes_many_of_these_": "Note on the silhouettes: many of these figures (especially the women) have no surviving portraits. The illustrations below are stylized period archetypes that signal era and role, not photographic likenesses. The point is that we know the work; we do not always know the face.",
