      "nobody_actually_does_65_on_295_everyon": "\"Nobody actually does 65 on 295 — everyone goes 75-80. You're gonna cause a pile-up going the limit.\"",
      "none_under_20_except_family_first_9_mo": " immediate family only unless a qualifying licensed operator is beside you",
      "note_the_70_hour_maine_requirement_is_": "Maine separately requires 70 hours of real supervised driving, 10 of them at night, before the road test. Simulator hours do not count toward those 70 — that log is kept with a licensed adult in a real car.",
