      "roadready_driving_hud_shows_current_sp": "RoadReady driving HUD: shows current speed in mph, score, elapsed time, fuel, and active warnings (seatbelt, speed limit, hazards). Controls: W or up arrow to accelerate, S or down arrow to brake, A and D or left and right arrows to steer, C to cycle camera, L to toggle high beams, Space to pause, Escape to end the drive.",
      "roadready_error": "🚗 RoadReady Error",
