      "strong_currents_surge_from_passing_ves": "Strong currents, surge from passing vessels, structural failure of the work piece. Always two divers + topside attendant + retrieval line.",
      "strong_demand_low_layoff_risk_in_skill": "Strong demand, low layoff risk in skilled trades",
      "structural_beam_to_column_weld_for_hig": "Structural beam-to-column weld for high-rise",
